@startuml
robust "Web Browser" as WB
concise "Web User" as WU
clock clk with period 50
binary "Enable" as EN
analog "Voltage" as V

@0
WU is Idle
WB is Idle
EN is low

@100
WU -> WB : URL
WU is Waiting
WB is Processing
EN is high
V is 5

@300
WB is Waiting
@WU
0 is Idle
+200 is Done
highlight 200 to 300 #Gold : busy
@enduml
